    "description": "Cross\nClassic Century Pen and Pencil Set - Chrome Finish\nVintage \"Couples Gift\" Edition, Original Case\nThis vintage Cross Classic Century set showcases the iconic slim silhouette and specialized engineering that have defined the brand since the mid-20th century. Featuring the distinctive black conical tops and a polished chrome finish, this set was marketed as a \"Couples Gift,\" presented in a dedicated two-toned green and cream clamshell case. The Classic Century remains a staple of American writing instrument design, valued for its balanced weight and reliable twist-action mechanism.\nPolished chrome-plated barrels with signature black conical end caps\nSet includes one twist-action ballpoint pen and one matching mechanical pencil\nOriginal vintage presentation box with \"Couples Gift\" silk lining and green textured exterior\nClassic slim profile designed for ergonomic comfort and professional portability\nCondition:\nVery good vintage condition. The chrome finish on both writing instruments is bright with only minor surface micro-scratching consistent with light handling. Twist mechanisms on both pieces are intact with no visible damage. The presentation case is structurally sound with a functional hinge; internal silk lining shows minimal age-related wear. Exterior of the case is clean with crisp branding.",
